{"parse":{"title":"Strum the Swirling Winds","pageid":187690,"revid":1850192,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Strum the Swirling Winds</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/8/85/Talent_Strum_the_Swirling_Winds.png/revision/latest?cb=20221207030125\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent Strum the Swirling Winds\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/8/85/Talent_Strum_the_Swirling_Winds.png/revision/latest?cb=20221207030125\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/8/85/Talent_Strum_the_Swirling_Winds.png/revision/latest?cb=20221207030125 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/8/85/Talent_Strum_the_Swirling_Winds.png/revision/latest?cb=20221207030125 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent Strum the Swirling Winds\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Strum_the_Swirling_Winds.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent Strum the Swirling Winds.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wanderer\" title=\"Wanderer\">Wanderer</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Utility_Passive\" title=\"Utility Passive\">Utility Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Passive_Talent\" title=\"Passive Talent\">Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mora\" title=\"Mora\">Mora</a> expended when ascending <a href=\"/wiki/Bow\" title=\"Bow\">Bows</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Catalyst\" title=\"Catalyst\">Catalysts</a> is decreased by 50%.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ascension_Cost_Reduction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ascension Cost Reduction\">Ascension Cost Reduction</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_Ascension_Cost_Reduction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon Ascension Cost Reduction\">Weapon Ascension Cost Reduction</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bow_Ascension_Cost_Reduction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bow Ascension Cost Reduction\">Bow Ascension Cost Reduction</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Catalyst_Ascension_Cost_Reduction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Catalyst Ascension Cost Reduction\">Catalyst Ascension Cost Reduction</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Mora_Cost_Reduction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mora Cost Reduction\">Mora Cost Reduction</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-content\">\"He doesn't like to talk about it much, but the Wanderer has quite a lot of experience in forging weapons.\"</div><hr class=\"description-separator\" /><div class=\"description-source\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Alice\" title=\"Alice\">Alice</a> in <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://youtu.be/12SZu2t6Ak8\">Collected Miscellany - \"Wanderer: Any Way the Wind Blows\"</a></i></div></div>\n<p><b>Strum the Swirling Winds</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Wanderer\" title=\"Wanderer\">Wanderer</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Utility_Passive\" title=\"Utility Passive\">Utility Passive</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FStrum_the_Swirling_Winds%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></